  "articleBody": "Custom kitchen cabinets are worth considering when standard sizes cannot solve your storage, layout, or style requirements. Before hiring a remodeling company, compare cabinet construction, site measurements, finish quality, hardware, installation, design coordination, and how plumbing, electrical, permits, countertops, and existing walls affect the complete scope. A detailed written proposal is more useful than a cabinet-only price.",
